00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:05.120
there was a lot of outcry

00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:06.850
and a lot of concern about,

00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:08.141
why do people think it's free?

00:02:08.141 --> 00:02:09.480
Why is that right?

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:11.000
If you make something

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:13.650
