00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:25.950
When you got a technology

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:28.763
that gives away what you do free,

00:02:30.180 --> 00:02:31.960
how do you compete with free?

00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:33.550
I mean...

00:02:33.550 --> 00:02:34.880
When Napster hit,

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:38.440
it wasn't just any issue
for the music industry.

00:02:38.440 --> 00:02:41.210
Young teenagers, teenagers, mind you,

00:02:41.210 --> 00:02:43.660
