00:03:32.620 --> 00:03:34.560
Then the Napster came out.

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:35.860
Yeah it was pretty,

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:37.110
it was massive, you know.

00:03:38.355 --> 00:03:40.230
I'll look on my songs on Napster

00:03:40.230 --> 00:03:43.240
and like see, see on it
like a lot, you know.

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:45.090
if a lot of search results came up,

00:03:45.090 --> 00:03:46.830
it was like a lot of people had it.

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:48.530
So you could kind of tell
like that, like, wow.

00:03:48.530 --> 00:03:50.453
So this stuff's really
spreading, you know.

