00:04:13.930 --> 00:04:17.373
have a career without having
a major label or contract.

00:04:19.090 --> 00:04:20.370
Benefit was

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:22.300
and is an awesome MC.

00:04:22.300 --> 00:04:24.773
But way ahead of his time.

00:04:25.830 --> 00:04:27.980
The major labels weren't paying attention

00:04:27.980 --> 00:04:30.540
to what was happening in the MP3 world

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:31.750
to their laws,

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:35.160
because the MP3 world
was like a minor leagues.

00:04:35.160 --> 00:04:37.820
And if somebody floats
to arise to the top,

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:39.550
then they could, you know,

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:41.650
swim off to that other level.

00:04:41.650 --> 00:04:44.520
The old paradigm from the last century,

00:04:44.520 --> 00:04:46.650
all he was good for that last century.

00:04:46.650 --> 00:04:47.483
The new century,

00:04:47.483 --> 00:04:50.070
I look at Napster as being new radio

00:04:50.070 --> 00:04:52.210
and people are finding ways

00:04:52.210 --> 00:04:54.370
that now you're going to
have a million artists,

00:04:54.370 --> 00:04:57.923
in a million labels, now
all in the record game.

