But then the flip side,

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:08.340
to making a living off
of music as a musician

00:05:08.340 --> 00:05:10.570
and suddenly your revenue streams,

00:05:10.570 --> 00:05:12.280
like cut off from under you, like, yeah,

